  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISK - Helsinki Citizens&#x2019; Assembly Vanadzor (HCAV)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK - Helsinki Citizens&#x2019; Assembly Vanadzor (HCAV)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conducting an internal control review of Helsinki Citizens&#x2019; Assembly Vanadzor NGO (HCAV) as it is a new partner for Sida to work with. This review will primarily focus on an analysis of the organizations&apos;s internal control systems in order to determine whether these can guarantee quality and accuracy in the entire organizational chain. The assignment includes a review in which routines and systems for operational and financial control are described and analysed. In addition, the consultant shall submit recommendations in respect of improvements deemed necessary.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK granskning av Helsinki Citizens&apos; Assembly Vanadzor NGO (HCAV) d&#xe5; det &#xe4;r en ny partner till Sida. Granskningen kommer i f&#xf6;rsta hand att fokusera p&#xe5; analys av organisationens interna kontrollsystem f&#xf6;r att avg&#xf6;ra om de kan garantera kvalitet och noggrannhet i hela organisationskedjan. I uppdraget ing&#xe5;r en genomg&#xe5;ng av deras rutiner och system. Dessutom ska konsulten l&#xe4;mna rekommendationer avseende f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar som bed&#xf6;ms n&#xf6;dv&#xe4;ndiga.</narrative>
  </description>
